        },
        {
          "type": "blockContainer",
          "attrs": { "id": "85833e38-edc5-49e8-a56d-e3d4651d5f6a" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "codeBlock",
              "attrs": { "language": "text" },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "graph TD\n    Client([Mobile / Web])\n\n    subgraph \"apps/api — Hono on Bun\"\n        Routes[Route Handlers]\n        Modules[Module Functions]\n        RedisAdapter[\"adapters/redis.ts (new)\"]\n    end\n\n    Redis[(Redis Railway TCP)]\n    Supabase[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]\n\n    Client --> Routes\n    Routes --> Modules\n    Modules --> RedisAdapter\n    RedisAdapter -- \"GET / SET EX 60\" --> Redis\n    Modules -- \"cache miss only\" --> Supabase\n\n    subgraph \"Keys cached in Redis\"\n        K1[\"membership:{albumId}:{userId} · 60s\"]\n        K2[\"album:{albumId} · 60s\"]\n        K3[\"member:{albumId}:{userId} · 60s\"]\n    end\n\n    Redis -.- K1\n    Redis -.- K2\n    Redis -.- K3"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "blockContainer",
          "attrs": { "id": "60d0116e-cea9-495e-b5bf-add811532333" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "backgroundColor": "default",
                "textColor": "default",
                "textAlignment": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }],
                  "text": "Request data flow (cache hit vs miss)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "blockContainer",
          "attrs": { "id": "fb80b1ec-caa3-4fff-9741-e3146e42d721" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "codeBlock",
              "attrs": { "language": "text" },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Client\n    participant R as Route Handler\n    participant M as Module Function\n    participant Cache as Redis\n    participant DB as Supabase\n\n    C->>R: GET /v1/albums/:id/media\n    R->>M: getMedia(albumId, userId)\n\n    M->>Cache: GET member:{albumId}:{userId}\n    alt hit (TTL ≤ 60s)\n        Cache-->>M: \"1\"  — skip DB entirely\n    else miss\n        M->>DB: SELECT from album_members WHERE album_id = ? AND user_id = ?\n        DB-->>M: row\n        M->>Cache: SET member:{albumId}:{userId} \"1\" EX 60\n    end\n\n    M->>Cache: GET album:{albumId}\n    alt hit\n        Cache-->>M: album JSON\n    else miss\n        M->>DB: SELECT from albums WHERE id = ?\n        DB-->>M: album row\n        M->>Cache: SET album:{albumId} JSON EX 60\n    end\n\n    M-->>R: GetMediaResult\n    R-->>C: 200 JSON"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "blockContainer",
          "attrs": { "id": "7a8a7554-ab26-4278-a57b-e0696d4d3f0f" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "backgroundColor": "default",
                "textColor": "default",
                "textAlignment": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The cache sits purely in the read path. Mutations go straight to Supabase; stale keys expire after 60 s. If Redis is unreachable, "
                },
                { "type": "text", "marks": [{ "type": "code" }], "text": "adapters/redis.ts" },
                { "type": "text", "text": " returns " },
                { "type": "text", "marks": [{ "type": "code" }], "text": "null" },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " on every get and silently skips sets — the API degrades to uncached behaviour rather than erroring."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
